{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "...Then let's be happy together.": "",
  "I want you to call me by my first name.": "",
  "Well. Let's keep in touch.": "",
  "Yeah. I'll be waiting for you.": "",
  "Are you gonna keep this a secret from Yosuke?": "",
  "For now... I think that would be best.": "",
  "Heh. Hope he doesn't ask me to investigate when he figures out you've got a boyfriend.": "",
  "Ahaha. He just might.": "",
  "And what about Ryuzenji?": "",
  "Hmm. I guess I'll just have to break it to him.": "",
  "Yeah, that might be a good idea.": "",
  "I'm sure not looking forward to it, though.": "",
  "Hope he doesn't start bawling his eyes out...": "",
  "Well... Bye for now.": "",
  "(All right. Looks like Tsukino-chan and I are official.)": "",
  "(I hope we can enjoy a long-lasting relationship together.)": "",
  "Sorry, Tsukino-chan. I'm flattered, but I don't think we can work.": "",
  "Wh-What? Why not...?": "",
  "I'm in a dangerous and unstable business. I have no idea what the future has in store for me.": "",
  "But you still have your whole life ahead of you. Besides, you have a true English gentleman waiting to take your hand.": "",
  "I don't think you should be dating a guy like me...": "",
  "Hmm. Then I guess we weren't meant to be.": "",
  "...Ahaha... looks like I didn't make the cut.": "",
  "And here I was, thinking I passed the most important interview of all.": "",
  "Sorry. I'm actually dating someone right now.": "",
  "Wait, you are!?": "",
  "Yeah. I didn't really have the opportunity to tell you.": "",
  "...Well. That stings, but I understand.": "",
  "(I do feel bad for Tsukino-chan... but that was the right thing to do.)": "",
  "So this is what a casino's like... How refined.": "",
  "(What should we do here?)": "",
  "You know how to play poker, Tsukino-chan?": "",
  "Oh, I do! I've seen my brother play.": "",
  "And you know all the rules?": "",
  "Umm, I'm not sure I remember them all. Will you teach me?": "",
  "Absolutely.": "",
  "And then once we're done reviewing, you and I can play together.": "",
  "Yeah! I'd like that!": "",
  "...So those are the rules. You got it?": "",
  "Got it! Thank you!": "",
  "Then let's go ahead and give it a try. I'll provide the betting money.": "",
  "Huh? Are you really okay with that?": "",
  "Of course. I can't just let a student pay.": "",
  "...In that case, I appreciate that.": "",
  "Done looking over the rules?": "",
  "Yeah! I'm all set!": "",
  "Then let's go ahead and play.": "",
  "Yes! Victory is mine!": "",
  "Wow, you're really good, Yagami-san!": "",
  "I didn't know you could gamble on top of everything else.": "",
  "Oh! Did I win?": "",
  "You sure did. Very impressive!": "",
  "Must be beginner's luck.": "",
  "Ah. Looks like both of us lost.": "",
  "Guess luck wasn't on our side today.": "",
  "Is this your first time playing darts?": "",
  "Well, I used to play a little with my friends from college.": "",
  "Oh, good. Wanna play together?": "",
  "Hmm... I doubt I could actually beat you.": "",
  "Nah, I'll go easy on you.": "",
  "All right, then. Let's get started.": "",
  "Okay. I won't lose!": "",
  "I don't intend on losing either.": "",
  "Sorry. I ended up going a little overboard.": "",
  "Gah. I didn't stand a chance...": "",
  "That's not true. I haven't been this fired up in a while.": "",
  "So I had to go all out in the end.": "",
  "Really? Well that makes me feel a little better.": "",
  "A tie... Not bad, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Hehe. I guess we're pretty evenly matched!": "",
  "For today.": "",
  "You look like you're not satisfied. Wanna play again?": "",
  "Of course. I'll get you this time.": "",
  "Ha, good luck with that!": "",
  "Yaaay! I won!": "",
  "You got me, Tsukino-chan. You're actually pretty good!": "",
  "Hehe. Guess I'm better than I thought.": "",
  "Have you ever been to a batting center?": "",
  "No. This is my first time.": "",
  "Okay, so all you need to do is hit every ball that comes flying at you... from unpredictable angles.": "",
  "That... sounds impossible. Even if I were athletic.": "",
  "How about I watch from the sidelines?": "",
  "Is that okay with you?": "",
  "Yeah! That way I can learn from the best!": "",
  "(All right. I'd better not screw this up.)": "",
  "Are you gonna watch or play?": "",
  "I'm gonna sit this one out. Swinging a bat around will probably make me too sore to get up tomorrow morning...": "",
  "Haha. That won't be good for your interview.": "",
  "Honestly, I think I'd feel better just watching you.": "",
  "Go for a home run, Yagami-san!": "",
  "(All right. This is my chance to impress her.)": "",
  "Sweet! I'm on fire today!": "",
  "Wow! That was awesome!": "",
  "Do you wanna give it a try now?": "",
  "I'm okay! I'm happy just watching.": "",
  "Haha. Okay then.": "",
  "That was... average.": "",
  "I'm impressed that you can even hit the ball.": "",
  "It's not that hard. Why don't you give it a try?": "",
  "Nope, not me. I wouldn't wanna pull a muscle or anything.": "",
  "Really? You're still so young, though...": "",
  "Hmm. That kinda sucked.": "",
  "Don't worry, it happens!": "",
  "(Damn. Now I have to redeem myself next time...)": "",
  "(Oh yeah. I should get something for Tsukino-chan before our date. Maybe some kinda present?)": "",
  "Takayuki-saaaan!": "",
  "Hey there. Sorry to drag you out on such short notice.": "",
  "It's fine, I was getting bored anyway.": "",
  "(Should I give Tsukino-chan a present?)": "",
  "I actually have something for you, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "You... actually went and bought me something?": "",
  "I did. Hope you like earrings.": "",
  "Wow! These are gorgeous! These are pearl, right?": "",
  "Yeah. Thought they'd look good on you.": "",
  "Aww, how sweet!": "",
  "Hehehe. Do you mind if I put them on now?": "",
  "Sure. I want to see too.": "",
  "So? What do you think?": "",
  "Oh wow. Those really are cute on you.": "",
  "Haha, stop making me blush.": "",
  "Check this out, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "...Aren't these things expensive?": "",
  "Well, sort of...": "",
  "I... I don't think I can accept something like this!": "",
  "But I bought it just for you. It would really make me happy if you took it.": "",
  "Okay, well... Thank you...": "",
  "Oh! Really?": "",
  "Yeah. Here, take it.": "",
  "What do you think?": "",
  "It's cute... but do you really think it fits me? I mean, these are prettier than I am.": "",
  "I wouldn't say that at all.": "",
  "Hmm... I'm not so sure.": "",
  "Well I am. I think they suit you just fine.": "",
  "Okay... Then I guess I'll try them on next time. Hope they don't stand out...": "",
  "(I guess they were a little too flashy.)": "",
  "Oh! You do?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm not sure if you'll like it, though.": "",
  "Wow, thank you so much! Seriously, this is awesome!": "",
  "(Nah, not this time.)": "",
  "Where do you want to go?": "",
  "(Hmm, what should we do...)": "",
  "How about we go to the casino?": "",
  "Ooh, nice choice. Very grown-up.": "",
  "Heh, something like that. Now let's get going.": "",
  "Wanna play some darts?": "",
  "Okay, that sounds great!": "",
  "What about the batting center?": "",
  "Yeah! Let's work up a good sweat!": "",
  "Thanks, Takayuki-san! I had so much fun today!": "",
  "Same. Thanks to you being with me.": "",
  "Always! Just say the word and I'm there!": "",
  "(Tsukino-chan always knows how to give me that energy boost I need. She's really something else...)": "",
  "I'll provide the bet, so play to your heart's content.": "",
  "Sorry to always make you pay for me.": "",
  "No problem. Now don't go holding back once the game starts.": "",
  "I won't! Besides, I probably couldn't beat you anyway.": "",
  "Wow! You're really good, Takayuki-san!": "",
  "Hehe, that's so like you.": "",
  "Huh? I won?": "",
  "You sure did. Nice going, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Hehehe. I guess that's what you'd call beginner's luck.": "",
  "I guess luck wasn't on our side today.": "",
  "Ready for a challenge?": "",
  "Yeah, and I want a real match this time, so don't go holding back!": "",
  "You really don't hold back, do you?": "",
  "Nope. That's my policy, for the most part.": "",
  "Hehe. I see you have a competitive side there.": "",
  "You've gotten pretty good, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Huh? Did I win?": "",
  "Not bad, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Hehe. I was just lucky.": "",
  "(Next time... she's going down.)": "",
  "Here I go! These baseballs won't know what hit 'em!": "",
  "Home run, here I come!": "",
  "I know I can get at least a single home run!": "",
  "Hey, that was great! I knew you could do it.": "",
  "(Nice. I managed to impress her today.)": "",
  "Looks like I did... okay.": "",
  "Well, I thought you did just fine. I notice you tend to be pretty strict on yourself.": "",
  "...Goddamn, that was terrible.": "",
  "(That was pretty lame.)": "",
  "Yagami-san! Sorry I made you wait!": "",
  "Whoa. Check out that outfit.": "",
  "Hehe, do you like it? This is what I've been wearing to my interviews.": "",
  "Even though it's just practice, I still wanted to look prepared!": "",
  "Our interview hasn't started yet, has it?": "",
  "You should check your jacket before we begin.": "",
  "So. Ready to start that practice interview?": "",
  "Yes! Yes I am! L-Let's get started!": "",
  "You sure? 'Cause you look nervous as heck.": "",
  "I-I do?": "",
  "Definitely. I think we should start when you're a little more relaxed.": "",
  "Why don't we go unwind somewhere?": "",
  "That's... considerate of you.": "",
  "Wearing this?": "",
  "Ah, you're fine. If anything, a suit would look good in a casino.": "",
  "Sure. If anything, let's just see how it goes.": "",
  "Want to play some darts?": "",
  "Yeah, that sounds good!": "",
  "Wearing an outfit like this?": "",
  "I'm sure there are people who go in their work clothes.": "",
  "Hmm. Maybe. Hope I don't get all sweaty.": "",
  "Thank you. I feel like this challenge isn't just my own anymore.": "",
  "I'm doing this for everyone that's supported me. For Ryuzenji-san, who held back for my benefit... and for you.": "",
  "Now I can walk forward with my head held high!": "",
  "I know you can do it, Tsukino-chan. Remember all the hard work you've put in and you can't go wrong.": "",
  "Right! I will!": "",
  "I do have one request, though.": "",
  "You do...?": "",
  "Why, you don't feel comfortable?": "",
  "N-No. It's not that... I mean, I guess I could try.": "",
  "Ta-Takayuki-san...": "",
  "...Haha, I guess it'll take some getting used to.": "",
  "Hehe. Right?": "",
  "You actually went and bought me something?": "",
  "Hehe. Can I put them on right now?": "",
  "Sure. I want to see how they look.": "",
  "I... don't think I can accept something like this!": "",
  "But I bought it just for you. It would really make me happy if you wore it.": "",
  "Okay, well... thank you...": "",
  "It's cute... but do you really think it fits me? I mean, these are way too pretty for me.": "",
  "(Wait... is that really how it's supposed to be?)": "",
  "(Maybe I can get a free pass on this one?)": "",
  "You mentioned something like that in your text, too.": "",
  "I will compensate you each for your loyalty. So back down, right this instant.": "",
  "Hey, you wore it!": "",
  "Wh-What do you think? Is it weird?": "",
  "No way! It looks great on you!": "",
  "Hehe, you think so? I feel a little awkward, but I like how it looks.": "",
  "What!? A present?": "",
  "Here. I hope it fits.": "",
  "What!? Clothes!?": "",
  "Well, I wasn't totally sure clothes would be the best gift...": "",
  "But I saw it, and I thought, you know, that would look good on you.": "",
  "Hehe. This is the first time anyone's bought clothes for me besides my mom.": "",
  "Thank you! I'll wear this next time we meet!": "",
  "Greetings, Yagami-san.": "",
  "...Is something wrong?": "",
  "It is as I feared. I can sense a bovine disaster forming in the air above you... Yes... I see the calamity of... a cow.": "",
  "Merely go about your usual business. Fear not, for I shall keep watch over you.": "",
  "That's it?": "",
  "Well, I suppose we could at least kill time somewhere...": "",
  "Since you're coming along, is there anything you've been wanting to do?": "",
  "Let me think... You know, I do have considerable talent for shogi.": "",
  "Shogi? That's pretty obscure...": "",
  "However, I wouldn't mind going wherever you want.": "",
  "As long as it has nothing to do with the sex industry.": "",
  "H-Hey, don't just assume I like that sort of thing.": "",
  "Really? I thought that all men were into that.": "",
  "(What kind of assumption is that...)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
